  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Description:Cute & Protective 🎀🎧 Bring fun to your everyday accessories with our Labubu Cartoon AirPods Cases. Made from durable TPU material, these cases protect your AirPods from scratches, drops, and dust while keeping them stylish and playful. Designed with adorable Labubu character prints in polka-dot patterns, they add a touch of cuteness and personality to your tech. Each case also comes with a matching Labubu keychain charm, making it extra fun and convenient to carry. Available in Red Polka and Brown Polka variants for a cheerful, trendy look.",
  "description_html": "<p>Description:Cute &amp; Protective 🎀🎧<br>Bring fun to your everyday accessories with our Labubu Cartoon AirPods Cases. Made from durable TPU material, these cases protect your AirPods from scratches, drops, and dust while keeping them stylish and playful. Designed with adorable Labubu character prints in polka-dot patterns, they add a touch of cuteness and personality to your tech. Each case also comes with a matching Labubu keychain charm, making it extra fun and convenient to carry. Available in Red Polka and Brown Polka variants for a cheerful, trendy look.</p>"
